  "description": "The WebGL/VRM avatar puppet — mn-vtuber, split out of @shrubbery/components into its own home for its heavier three/@pixiv/three-vrm footprint. Depends on @shrubbery/components (SkinAware) + lit + three + @pixiv/three-vrm — NEVER stores/auth/tauri/@shrubbery/runtime.",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "LicenseRef-PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0",
